    "about": "US EPA Method 200.7, Revision 4.4 (1994, public domain): metals by ICP-AES. Its reagents give chemical formulas whose subscripts are set smaller and lower, drawn after the word's letters and set back into a space the producer wrote between them (`As`, a space, `O`, then the `2` of As₂O₃ drawn in the space)."
  },
